{
  "summary": "Focused CLI-side revisions only (no driver, RTL, or Linux changes). bench/idma_experiment.c: rename the undeclared IDMA_P4M_WORDS16/IDMA_P4M_OBS_WORDS35 to the real UAPI IDMA_P4M_WORDS/IDMA_P4M_OBS_WORDS; require observer_status == 4 and sequence != 0; require window cycles == observation[0]; require legacy V issued/done (observation[7]/[8]) == victim_transfers; mirror the strengthened driver record invariants (0/1 stock fields, ID bounds, contiguous in-order done IDs, opening first-done ID, closing ID rule, opening-edge issue implies opening stock, strict pre-opening cohort flag, carried-done equality) in validate_p4m; rename a_done_before_open to a_started_before_window_completed and add a_started_before_window_bytes (boundary bound <= 1 job / 4096 bytes); replace the wrong integer a_completed_jobs_per_ns with primary a_completed_bytes_per_second and optional a_completed_jobs_per_second computed in floating point with a cycles*20 overflow guard; gate derived time/progress/rate fields on the accepted-valid run (success) instead of only the raw error mask while always retaining raw_window/raw_observation; and repair the P4M semantics JSON that emitted doubled quotes at string boundaries so every P4M record parses with json.loads. tests/experiment_cli_test_stub.c: make the good fixtures satisfy the frozen raw16/raw35 contract (observer_status 4, sequence 1, count0 == window cycles, legacy V counts, single coherent in-flight/done ID cohort, strict carry flag) and add focused bad-row modes. tests/experiment_cli_test.py: update the P4M assertions (Solo progress 0, corun 10 jobs, exact and tolerance-checked non-integer rates, derived-null on invalid rows, json.loads on success and error P4M records). tests/test_board_p4m.py: add a stubbed host simulation of the four short cases using a temporary copy of tests/board-p4m.sh in which only the fixed PATH line and the /proc taint path are substituted; production paths and the script itself are untouched.",
